      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Poll data from object referencing properties in SrcData, Note: SrcData is a UObject containing properties.\nBehaves like PollPropertyReplicationState when it comes to dirtiness and such.\n@return True if any state is dirty, false if not."
